{"id":"a6bf8d66277e0319","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_STDenote.md","title":"STDenote","display":"STDenote","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"STDenote","parameters":["B","C","k","eta","iota","g","t","a","e","v"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"STDenote"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>B</span><span>C</span><span>k</span><span>eta</span><span>iota</span><span>g</span><span>t</span><span>a</span><span>e</span><span>v</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：简单类型集合语义。有序参数：<code>B</code>、<code>C</code>、<code>k</code>、<code>eta</code>、<code>iota</code>、<code>g</code>、<code>t</code>、<code>a</code>、<code>e</code>、<code>v</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ STDenote B C k eta iota g t a e v)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists tau\n  (exists s\n    (and\n      (@ STDenTable B C k eta iota tau s)\n      (exists z1196\n        (and\n          (exists z1197\n            (and\n              (exists z1198\n                (and (exists z1199 (and (@ Pair e v z1199) (@ Pair a z1199 z1198))) (@ Pair t z1198 z1197)))\n              (@ Pair g z1197 z1196)))\n          (in z1196 s))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"23ae0c7821c928ba\" href=\"?note=23ae0c7821c928ba\" title=\"ZFC_STDenTable\">STDenTable</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ STDenote B C k eta iota g t a e v)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Pair","status":"resolved","id":"0a7fe33bb2e95221","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_STDenTable|STDenTable]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_STDenTable","status":"resolved","id":"23ae0c7821c928ba","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_STDenTable|STDenTable]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":1199,"backlinks":[{"id":"80fb57ef7d250c19","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_STDenote|STDenote]]"},{"id":"29a3b60439beb1f3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_Empty|Empty]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]；[[ZFC_STDenote|STDenote]]；[[ZFC_STErase|STErase]]；[[ZFC_STType|STType]]"},{"id":"4d7c649d7ac211f6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_Empty|Empty]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]；[[ZFC_STDenote|STDenote]]"},{"id":"bc9634392c38f719","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_Empty|Empty]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]；[[ZFC_STDenote|STDenote]]"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a